// SMMC Arsenal Gate 2 — canonical-source closure certificate v1.
//
// This is an item-level reviewed decision inventory. It closes the architectural
// hole identified by independent review: the positive HARVEST set is no longer
// the only executable object. Every candidate-like source item encountered under
// the bounded selectors below has exactly one disposition.
//
// Gate-2 semantics only:
// - HARVEST => preserve as raw ore, pointing to a raw candidate ID.
// - EXCLUDE => does not satisfy this bounded source-harvest rule as an independent
//   raw row. This is NOT a Gate-3 ontology/granularity/importance judgment.
// - Same-looking terms from different canonical sources remain independent.

